Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:33.98,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(35,280)\fscx55\fad(527,1)}Who Is This Mission For?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:40.56,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You two, stay back, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:43.71,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's a weapon I haven't seen very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.85,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Is it a mid-range type?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:48.92,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It would be difficult to run \Naway with both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:50.41,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:58.64,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He won't let me near him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.32,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,He's quite skilled at using his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.00,main,Guest A,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:03.68,main,Guest B,0,0,0,,A fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:06.19,top,Guest C,0,0,0,,Wait... Is that guy swinging \Nsomething sharp around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.77,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Th-This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:07.77,top,Guest D,0,0,0,,Someone, go get security.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:11.06,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,We're definitely bringing \Nattention to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:13.76,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do? This is going \Nto turn into a commotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow, this is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:18.60,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Huh? Miss Anya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.60,0:02:20.99,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, no! If she sees me like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:25.94,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Wow! The lady from the circus is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.34,main,Guest E,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a street performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.30,main,Guest F,0,0,0,,This really is a luxury cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.65,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Sh-She really saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,It appears Miss Anya doesn't \Nrecognize me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.69,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Now's my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.29,main,Guest C,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:49.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,This hallway has nothing I can use as cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.62,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,There's a crowd watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.43,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,And behind me, the ones I want to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:55.56,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's making it difficult. \NI can't get close to him at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.97,0:03:00.31,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.23,0:03:03.07,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,My legs are heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:04.74,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.57,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm hesitating to step forward?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:10.96,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I don't even have to worry about a \Nsevere injury with a weapon like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:13.39,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You've got this, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.39,0:03:15.96,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Hurry and beat that guy up \Nbefore Papa comes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:20.58,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'll just have to risk getting hit, \Ngrab his chain, and pull him down...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:24.12,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,No, I think I need to make \Nthis look more showy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:25.86,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,or they'll become suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:29.54,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What should I do? Um... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.31,main,Guest E,0,0,0,,You've got this, old guy! \NShow us some better moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:37.89,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,Tch. I messed up, and now there \Nare tons of people watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.89,0:03:39.31,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:43.31,italics,Barnaby,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just mow her down \Nalong with everyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.45,main,Guest A,0,0,0,,Man, that was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:27.75,main,Guest C,0,0,0,,I don't think I really \Ngot the concept, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.58,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:32.79,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I think I'll start listening to \Nher a little more from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:36.79,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,There! Perfect! This should make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:36.03,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ah! Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.75,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to get back to the shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.68,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Where did you go, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:44.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,There was a circus over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya was successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.55,0:04:50.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I was able to help Mama
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:53.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,and complete the mission \Nwithout Papa finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:05:00.26,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Hero Anya cannot contain her excitement \Nfrom this epic adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:12.70,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'd like all of these items.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:15.81,main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,Y-You look lovely, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.22,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:22.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No matter how you look at it, \NI am clearly a fun and happy dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.70,0:05:25.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Could you be any lamer? Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.11,0:05:31.14,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.14,0:05:35.64,main,Crew A,0,0,0,,Man, just how crazy was the \Ndomestic disturbance over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:38.89,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,That ice pick was gross! Talk about scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:42.56,main,Crew B,0,0,0,,Thank goodness there wasn't \Na murder on this cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.90,main,Crew A,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.99,0:06:06.84,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Blue Lace No. 89 and \NMermaid eau de toilette...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:10.17,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,These are different fragrances than \Nthe ones I noticed at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:13.22,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I guess she changed that along with her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.55,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,There were at least two women and one man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:19.62,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I guess the woman who had \Nno scent was the bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.25,0:06:23.74,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,It's me. Where are they headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.19,italics,Informant,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:30.76,main,Informant,0,0,0,,There's a very high chance they've snuck \Ninto the second- or third-class rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.43,italicstop,Random guests,0,0,0,,Look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:31.54,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,So you're over the bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.81,main,Informant,0,0,0,,but I haven't heard anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.81,0:06:35.25,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,I guess I'll plant someone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:38.34,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Considering the ship's route,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:42.23,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,they're probably going to try to defect \Nsometime tomorrow night or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:46.21,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,When that time comes, they'll have \Nno choice but to show themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:46.90,italicstop,Random guests,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.21,0:06:48.54,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.52,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:52.03,italics,Random guests,0,0,0,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.03,0:06:54.00,italics,Random guests,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.26,italics,Bald Guy A,0,0,0,,Did you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:56.62,italics,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:59.35,italics,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to go \Nto the third deck for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:02.31,main,Bald Guy A,0,0,0,,Man, talk about a useless informant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:05.81,main,Bald Guy A,0,0,0,,He'd better not be thinking he'll \Njust take the money and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.85,0:07:08.81,main,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:10.80,main,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,In fact, we can probably get back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:13.92,main,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,what we paid him before \Nhe disembarks the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:17.21,italics,Bald Guy A,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do once we get paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.27,italicstop,Bald Guy B,0,0,0,,Let's see... First, I'm \Ngonna get some chicks...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.99,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I guess stupid people really \Nare just everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.00,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I guess I'll at least get prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:32.89,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(230,290)\fs15\fsp.1}Ended up not buying anything
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.55,top,Loid,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going? \NOur room's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:33.60,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama's in trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:39.57,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm sure she's working late, \Nbut that doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.57,0:07:42.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's past your bedtime. Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:46.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But Anya's adventure has only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:08:00.49,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She never contacted us, \Nso she's probably busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.03,0:08:03.01,main,Yor,0,0,0,,No one followed us, and no wiretaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll be able \Nto relax for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:10.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It looks like the director has \Nprepared some food for us, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:13.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We should be able to hole up in \Nhere until the other boat arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.79,main,Olka,0,0,0,,There, there. Quiet, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:22.22,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Man, that was scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:24.34,main,Grey,0,0,0,,What the hell is the deal with those guys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:26.14,main,Grey,0,0,0,,What's wrong with assassins?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:29.28,main,Grey,0,0,0,,They just go around the ship shooting \Nguns and swinging sickles around!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:31.54,main,Grey,0,0,0,,You can't be serious! I wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:33.35,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Stop making such a fuss, you moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.35,0:08:37.00,main,Grey,0,0,0,,But did you see how built those guys were?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.25,main,Grey,0,0,0,,They're not human!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:42.60,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Honestly... You really are just a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.60,main,Olka,0,0,0,,It's so pathetic I could almost cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.12,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Not you too, Young Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:52.28,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't grow \Nup to be like him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:58.42,main,Olka,0,0,0,,By the way, why'd you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:02.94,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You had no reason to put \Nyourself in all this danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.94,0:09:05.67,main,Olka,0,0,0,,You could've just stayed \Nin the new organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:10.47,main,Grey,0,0,0,,W-Well... that's because you're... I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:11.00,main,Olka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.28,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Er, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:16.86,main,Grey,0,0,0,,P-Please don't underestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:20.45,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I'm not so rotten that I'd forget\Neverything the boss did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:24.33,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Right after the war, \Nwhen there was nothing to eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:27.31,main,Grey,0,0,0,,If it hadn't been for the black \Nmarket that the family ran,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:29.21,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I would've starved to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.08,0:09:31.28,flashback,Young Olka,0,0,0,,Here, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.09,flashback,Young Olka,0,0,0,,Shh. Don't tell anyone else about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.76,flashback,Olka's father,0,0,0,,Hey, Olka. Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.73,0:09:54.16,main,Grey,0,0,0,,To this day, I remember exactly \Nhow that bread tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.85,main,Grey,0,0,0,,That's all the reason I need to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:02.12,main,Olka,0,0,0,,Zeb...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:07.48,main,Grey,0,0,0,,A-And did you know that \NHapoon's being all buddy-buddy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:11.32,main,Grey,0,0,0,,with pro-war extremists to get \Nrich through arms dealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.46,main,Grey,0,0,0,,He's a total piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.81,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Leave this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:19.17,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Even if Hapoon's lackeys come \Nafter us, I'll beat 'em all to a pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:22.76,main,Grey,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! That was a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:26.28,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Good work, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.77,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Earlier, you forgot about our secret knock
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:34.70,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,and went close to the door, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.85,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'd like the three of you \Nto rest up for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:43.00,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'll leave Forger on guard at the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.20,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Wh-Who the hell can sleep in this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.84,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What will you do, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:51.32,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I'm going to have a look around this floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.01,0:10:55.21,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,and if possible, thin out the threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.57,main,Grey,0,0,0,,You guys really are a piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:59.76,main,Grey,0,0,0,,People are trying to kill you, \Nand you're so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:01.00,main,Grey,0,0,0,,You're not right in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:03.56,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,This is our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:08.13,main,Grey,0,0,0,,So killing and getting killed \Nis just a given for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.56,main,Grey,0,0,0,,It's been over ten years \Nsince the war ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:14.86,main,Grey,0,0,0,,But I guess war is always \Njust lurking around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:21.67,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,As long as we people continue to \Nbe people, conflict will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:25.19,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Whether it's wartime or peacetime...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.69,0:11:28.71,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,We are nothing more than \Nsoldiers for our countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:33.71,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,If necessary, I will signal with my footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:35.43,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Keep your guard up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:37.21,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.45,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Forger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:40.71,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:45.23,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Concentrate on the mission, \Nor we're all going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.24,main,Grey,0,0,0,,Man, he's scary! So that's what a pro is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:01.11,main,Yor,0,0,0,,The director is right. It's best \Nthat the three of you rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.45,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if you just lie down for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.79,main,Yor,0,0,0,,You need to save your energy for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.93,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Please keep your shoes on so we \Ncan move immediately if need be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.00,main,Grey,0,0,0,,G-Got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm turning off the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:50.72,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Come to think of it... I never was \Nable to contact Loid or Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.20,0:12:53.56,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But this isn't the time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:04.58,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,The heaviness I felt in my legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:09.49,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,might've just been me being \Nscared that I would get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.55,0:13:14.21,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,If those two ever see me so badly hurt \Nthat I can't talk my way out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.56,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I won't be able to stay in my home anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:21.14,flashback,Olka,0,0,0,,That family's just for camouflage, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:26.74,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,That's right, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.33,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I need to get my priorities straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:30.03,sign_8868_85_Little_Brother,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(231,180)\move(405,20,,380,20)}Little\NBrother
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.26,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.72,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,What am I doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:45.97,sign_13319_178__But_then_John_r,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(60,120)\fs20}About 20 hours\Nuntil rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.50,0:13:55.34,main,Franky,0,0,0,,So tired... Why am I up so early in the \Nmorning taking the doggo for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:56.19,main,Bond,0,0,0,,Borf! Borf!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:58.03,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Enough of your borfing, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:01.55,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I ain't a petsitter, nor a kiddositter, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.19,main,Franky,0,0,0,,I'm busy at work in the shadows! \NGive me back my precious time, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.94,main,Woman,0,0,0,,Oh, what a cute doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.94,0:14:07.66,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:10.70,main,Woman,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:12.56,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:16.87,main,Woman,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you before. \NDo you live around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.46,main,Franky,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:21.96,main,Woman,0,0,0,,I hope I see you again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:28.21,main,Franky,0,0,0,,You wanna come live with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:37.18,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,My name is Twilight. \NI am the best spy in Westalis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:42.58,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No matter the situation, \Neven in the face of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:45.66,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've been trained to always keep my cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:49.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,My observation skills, decision-making skills,\N ability to respond to any situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Each of those has been honed to its peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.78,0:14:54.67,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's how I made my way \Nin the world until today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:55.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.57,0:14:57.08,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,Don't come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.84,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,Could you be any lamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:03.50,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'd gotten ahead of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:07.42,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There are still many unknown \Nthings in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:11.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't become overconfident based on \Nmere information and experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:14.46,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The root of everyone's fear is the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.46,0:15:17.17,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Death, the evil spirits we \Ncannot see with our own eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.17,0:15:18.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,neighbors and nearby countries...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.71,0:15:21.85,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Not knowing who or what they \Nare is what brings fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.86,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Some just accept the fact that \Nthese things are incomprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,In other words, they act \Nlike they don't see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:31.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Others think they know and can label \Neverything, putting their hearts at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:36.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm a secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:38.54,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I do not fear the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:42.55,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,No... I fear it as I should, \Nand then deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:46.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Just as scientists shone \Nlight into the darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:49.17,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Just as they discovered \Nviruses and vaccines...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.90,0:15:52.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,On the second day of this cruise,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:55.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I will somehow traverse the \Ndifficult obstacle before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.65,0:16:06.50,main,Vides,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:08.16,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,We're done entertaining our guests?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:11.58,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,It appears the mister and missus \Ngot into an awful fight last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.58,0:16:15.62,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,The missus was quite displeased when she \Nfound Mister Grey had pooped his pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:18.26,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,so she's not in the mood for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:20.34,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.92,main,Vides,0,0,0,,So about the tourist attraction...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.92,0:16:23.29,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,It's probably back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:27.15,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. You two \Ndidn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.07,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,I will take care of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.14,main,Matthew,0,0,0,,You two are free to do \Nwhatever you'd like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.71,main,Heymann,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:34.80,italics,Vides,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:39.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Adventure! Exploring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.60,0:16:44.85,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hero Anya's adventures continue another day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:50.30,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,My observation skills, decision-making \Nskills, my ability to respond to any situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:50.81,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Super-exciting adventures! \NSuper-exciting detective hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:55.87,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I fell asleep yesterday, but I need to hurry \Nup and find Mama so I can help her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:56.82,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:17:01.21,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa! Mama's in trouble!\NWe gotta hurry up and save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:03.09,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What?! What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:06.62,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Impossible! Yor goes around having battles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.62,0:17:09.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I can't believe this! Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:11.28,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's bound to happen, so I can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:15.34,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I have to figure out somewhere to lose Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:19.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, look! They have golfing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Did you want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.81,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but adults love golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:31.40,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,My plan is to sneak away while \NPapa is concentrating on golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:37.44,main,Guest F,0,0,0,,H-He got a hole-in-one on every hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:38.50,main,Guest G,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:41.30,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock! He's already done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:43.50,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Go on. Now you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.48,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:51.46,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Grr! Hngh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down. Aim better.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:01.06,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's about time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:02.77,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's gonna keep playing until it goes in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:06.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Hmm... Having her experience \Nsuccess is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I guess I'll let her keep \Nplaying until she gets it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.48,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Decision. Response.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.37,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Stop yelling. You'll bother the other guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Grr!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:21.78,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I fell for Papa's trap and \Nended up wasting time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:24.38,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I need to think up the next plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:25.67,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Chew your food well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.97,0:18:28.09,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa loves this thing called knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.09,0:18:30.16,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can keep Papa busy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:35.35,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've read all these books before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.47,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, as long as she's having fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.47,0:18:41.92,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Oh! Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Puzzles are so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:50.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This looks like it'll be really hard if \NI don't have Papa help me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:53.58,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,If I just need to line up the pieces, \NI can finish in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:54.52,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:01.40,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.87,0:19:04.99,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:13.37,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to escape Papa, \Nand now it's time for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.94,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Heck, at some point, I forgot about Mama \Nand was just enjoying myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:18.18,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mrgggh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.37,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.87,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why are you glaring at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:23.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,You were clearly having fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:25.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Why do you look so grumpy now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.49,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Did I make a mistake somewhere?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.49,0:19:30.92,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Calm down, Twilight. Face the unknown!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:33.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Does she hate me? Or is she just \Ngoing through a rebellious phase?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:36.61,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Forgers \Nare going to fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:39.93,main,Loid,0,0,0,,D-Do you have a stomachache?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:40.87,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.25,0:19:44.38,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya's worrying Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:45.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya is enjoying her adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:51.45,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see. Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:55.78,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But Mama's gone, so I miss her a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:19:59.99,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Anya wants to be with Papa and Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:03.17,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's why I have to go help Mama by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:05.04,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:06.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:08.85,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It would've been nice if Yor \Ncould've had some time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.41,0:20:12.57,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,She's still a very small child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.35,0:20:16.39,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She may not be, but why don't we \Njust ask her if she's free tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.39,0:20:18.52,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Do you know where Mama is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.77,0:20:22.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,No... But I'll leave a message \Nwith the concierge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:24.98,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Once we get a reply,\N let's meet up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.98,0:20:25.95,main,Anya,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:29.74,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I know. There are going to be \Nfireworks up on the deck later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:33.32,main,Loid,0,0,0,,It's the main event for tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:36.24,main,Loid,0,0,0,,so maybe Yor and the people she's \Nwith will go and watch, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.24,0:20:39.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,There'll be a big crowd, so I don't know \Nif we'll find her, but do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.53,0:20:41.70,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Fireworks! I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:00.68,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.74,0:21:02.54,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.44,main,Yor,0,0,0,,That was the director.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:10.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,He's received word from the rendezvous ship.\N They said they are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:13.31,main,Yor,0,0,0,,We'll be meeting with them in four hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:16.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,but we need to get ready. \NAnd most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:19.70,main,Yor,0,0,0,,the enemy's closing in on this deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:22.00,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So we're going to leave this room \Nand go to another point.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.44,0:21:24.94,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Everyone, please change. We also have wigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.53,main,Grey,0,0,0,,A-All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.81,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,It's me. Any movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:33.99,main,Informant,0,0,0,,I've intercepted an anonymous secret message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.99,0:21:36.98,main,Informant,0,0,0,,It's different from the State \NSecurity Service's frequency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.47,italics,Glasses,0,0,0,,It could be a signal to the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:39.81,main,Informant,0,0,0,,Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:42.57,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,All right. Sending this to everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:46.02,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Stand by at stage three positions\N and ambush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:54.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right. No enemies in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:56.38,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:18.04,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The bright crimson that \Nappears right before my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.75,0:22:27.94,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stretches approximately 40,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.06,0:22:35.79,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our wounds that inch closer behind us
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:40.87,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Make us wander even more \Nwhen we're already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.87,0:22:45.46,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,The unseeable, scentless, unmistakable future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:47.39,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Stabbed me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.55,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.55,0:22:58.09,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Let me stay by your side tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:23:05.81,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Just for tonight, I'm going to be serious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.68,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Come closer to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.97,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Even the future we prayed for
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.97,0:23:14.00,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Has a different path
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:17.54,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,My dear
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.09,0:23:21.60,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Our malice for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:24.88,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Might just get to us
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.25,0:23:29.48,italicstop,ED,0,0,0,,Or maybe not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.97,0:23:39.97,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,240)\fscx54}The Symphony Upon the Ship
